      "message": "did you mean to say \u0027is *not* -1187158727 (b1-dev key)\u0027 in the original comment? Or I am lost because in the prod manifest key id is not -1.\n\nAlso, since this script does not allow to specify the manifest manually, I don\u0027t see how checking the manifest contents would help anything.\n\nThe prod manifest is not used unless prod signing is required.\n\nRefusing to prod sign images built with CR50_DEV is a good idea, but I don\u0027t know how to enforce it yet, and would rather leave this for future enhancements.\n\nThe method to avoid accidents for now is just to keep the prod fob away, which I do and everybody should be doing.",
